Package: saremRanges
Title: Access and Process SAREM Mammal Distribution Ranges
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Agustina", "Novillo", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "agusnov7@gmail.com")
Description: Provides experimental tools to query, filter, download, clean,
    and export mammal distribution ranges and detailed species attributes from the Categorizacion de los
    Mamiferos de Argentina (CMA-SAREM). The package distinguishes distribution
    ranges from auxiliary map layers and returns spatial data as 'sf' objects.
    Taxonomic and geographic filters accept multiple values, including
    Argentine provinces and terrestrial ecoregions.
    This is an experimental package developed independently of SAREM.
